Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That might be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He has many pieces of the puzzle you're trying to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he knew your father, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to come here to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I helped my father in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,By then my father was an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And the restaurant was a fine place then, much smarter than today.
